Package: COILplus
Type: Package
Title: Covariate-Informed Latent Interaction Models for Bipartite Networks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jennifer", "Kampe", email = "jenniferkampe@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the COIL and COIL+ models for predicting unobserved
    interactions in bipartite ecological networks using species trait
    information, phylogenetic correlations, and informative occurrence priors.
    COIL+ extends the original BiasedNetwork implementation (Papadogeorgou
    et al., 2023) with blocked sampling of occurrence probabilities and major
    efficiency improvements. Includes support for parallel trait-matching
    analysis via permutation tests.
